{"task_id": "HumanEval/48", "solution": "def is_palindrome(text: str):\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if given string is a palindrome\n    >>> is_palindrome('')\n    True\n    >>> is_palindrome('aba')\n    True\n    >>> is_palindrome('aaaaa')\n    True\n    >>> is_palindrome('zbcd')\n    False\n    \"\"\"\n    if not isinstance(text, str):\n        raise TypeError(f\"is_palindrome expects a str, got {type(text).__name__}\")\n\n    left = 0\n    right = len(text) - 1\n\n    while left < right:\n        if text[left] != text[right]:\n            return False\n        left += 1\n        right -= 1\n    return True"}
