{"task_id": "HumanEval/81", "solution": "def numerical_letter_grade(grades):\n    \"\"\"Converts a list of numeric GPA values into their corresponding letter grades based on a specific grading table.\"\"\"\n    letter_grades = []\n    for gpa in grades:\n        gpa_float = float(gpa)\n        if gpa_float >= 4.0:\n            letter_grades.append('A+')\n        elif gpa_float > 3.7:\n            letter_grades.append('A')\n        elif gpa_float > 3.3:\n            letter_grades.append('A-')\n        elif gpa_float > 3.0:\n            letter_grades.append('B+')\n        elif gpa_float > 2.7:\n            letter_grades.append('B')\n        elif gpa_float > 2.3:\n            letter_grades.append('B-')\n        elif gpa_float > 2.0:\n            letter_grades.append('C+')\n        elif gpa_float > 1.7:\n            letter_grades.append('C')\n        elif gpa_float > 1.3:\n            letter_grades.append('C-')\n        elif gpa_float > 1.0:\n            letter_grades.append('D+')\n        elif gpa_float > 0.7:\n            letter_grades.append('D')\n        elif gpa_float > 0.0:\n            letter_grades.append('D-')\n        else:\n            letter_grades.append('E')\n    return letter_grades"}
